-- title:
--   Hecke eigencharacter of a normalised weight-two eigenform is integral
-- statement:
--   Let $N$ be a nonzero natural number and suppose [`CuspForm.HasIntegralStructure N 2`](def/CuspForm_IntegralStructure.html#L6) holds, i.e. the $\mathbb{C}$-span of the $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ generated by those cusp forms all of whose $q$-expansion coefficients $\mathrm{qCoeff}(f,n)$ (the coefficients of the $q$-expansion of width $1$) are rational integers is the whole space. Let $f$ be a cusp form of weight $2$ for $\Gamma_0(N)$ satisfying `IsNormalizedEigenform`: its first $q$-coefficient is $1$, its coefficients are multiplicative on coprime indices, and for every prime $p$ they satisfy $a_{p^{r+2}} = a_p a_{p^{r+1}} - p\,a_{p^r}$ when $p \nmid N$ and $a_{p^{r+2}} = a_p a_{p^{r+1}}$ when $p \mid N$. Let $S$ be any set of natural numbers. Then there is a ring homomorphism $\chi$ from [`CuspForm.heckeAlgebra N 2 S`](def/CuspForm_HeckeAlgebra.html#L18) — the $\mathbb{Z}$-subalgebra of $\operatorname{End}_{\mathbb{C}} S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ generated by the operators $T_\ell$ for primes $\ell \nmid N$ with $\ell \notin S$ together with the operators $U_q$ for primes $q \mid N$ with $q \notin S$ — to the integral closure of $\mathbb{Z}$ in $\mathbb{C}$, such that for every $t$ in that algebra the endomorphism underlying $t$ sends $f$ to $(\chi t) \cdot f$, the scalar being the complex number underlying $\chi t$. Unlike the $\mathbb{C}$-valued version it is derived from, the statement records no formula for $\chi$ on the generators.
--
--   This is the integrality of the Hecke eigenvalues of a normalised weight-two eigenform: the eigencharacter of the anemic Hecke algebra away from $S$ takes values in the ring of algebraic integers. It is the form of the eigencharacter used to pass between eigenforms and maximal ideals of the Hecke algebra, in particular in the reduction of eigenvalues modulo a prime above $p$ and in the congruence statements built on it.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CuspForm_IsNormalizedEigenform_exists_ringHom_heckeAlgebra_integralClosure.lean

import Definitions.Def_CuspForm_HeckeAlgebra
import Definitions.Def_CuspForm_IntegralStructure
import Mathlib.RingTheory.IntegralClosure.Algebra.Basic

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
